<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Activate Your Learnex Account</title>

    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        background: #f4f7fb;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        padding: 30px 15px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .header {
        background: #4f46e5;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 35px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .header h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .header p {
        opacity: 0.9;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 40px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .content h2 {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        color: #111827;
      }

      .otp-box {
        margin: 30px auto;
        width: 220px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #eef2ff;
        border: 2px dashed #4f46e5;
        font-size: 34px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 10px;
        color: #4f46e5;
      }

      .note {
        margin-top: 25px;
        background: #f9fafb;
        border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
      }

      .footer {
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #777;
        background: #fafafa;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      }

      a {
        color: #4f46e5;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Learnex</h1>
        <p>Learn. Build. Grow.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Hello <%= user.name %>, 👋</h2>

        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>Learnex</strong>! We're excited to have you join
          our learning community.
        </p>

        <p>To activate your account, please use the verification code below:</p>

        <div class="otp-box"><%= activationCode %></div>

        <p>Enter this code in the activation page to verify your account.</p>

        <div class="note">
          <strong>Security Tip:</strong><br />
          This code is valid for <strong>5 minutes</strong>. Never share it with
          anyone. Learnex will never ask for your verification code.
        </div>

        <br />

        <p>
          If you didn't create a Learnex account, you can safely ignore this
          email.
        </p>

        <br />

        <p>Happy Learning! 🚀</p>

        <p>
          <strong>The Learnex Team</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Learnex. All rights reserved.
        <br /><br />
        Learn skills from industry experts and advance your career.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
